export const defaultBanks=[['sber','СБЕР'],['t','Т-БАНК'],['alfa','Альфа-Банк'],['ozon','OZON Банк'],['gazprom','ГазпромБанк'],['vtb','ВТБ'],['yandex','Яндекс']].map(([id,name])=>({id,name,logo:id,hidden:false}));
export const blankCashback=()=>({version:2,banks:structuredClone(defaultBanks),months:{},categories:[],favorites:[],lockedMonths:[]});
export function upgradeCashback(input){if(input.version===2)return {...structuredClone(input),favorites:input.favorites??[],lockedMonths:input.lockedMonths??[]};const data=blankCashback();for(const [month,banks]of Object.entries(input.months||{})){data.months[month]={};for(const b of data.banks){const text=banks[b.name];if(typeof text!=='string')continue;data.months[month][b.id]=text.split(/;|\n|,(?!\d)/).filter(s=>s.trim()).map(s=>{const m=s.trim().match(/^(.*?)\s+(\d+(?:[.,]\d+)?)\s*%\s*$/);return {name:(m?m[1]:s).trim(),percent:m?Number(m[2].replace(',','.')):null};});}}return data;}
export function validateCashback(input){const d=upgradeCashback(input||{}),bad=()=>{throw Object.assign(new Error('Проверьте банки, категории и проценты кэшбэка.'),{status:400});};if(!Array.isArray(d.banks)||d.banks.length>100||!d.months||typeof d.months!=='object'||Array.isArray(d.months)||Object.keys(d.months).length>1200||!Array.isArray(d.categories)||d.categories.length>5000)bad();const ids=new Set();for(const b of d.banks){if(typeof b.id!=='string'||!/^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,80}$/.test(b.id)||ids.has(b.id)||typeof b.name!=='string'||!b.name.trim()||b.name.length>100||!['sber','t','alfa','ozon','gazprom','vtb','yandex','generic'].includes(b.logo)||typeof b.hidden!=='boolean')bad();ids.add(b.id);}for(const [period,entries] of Object.entries(d.months)){if(!/^20\d\d-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$/.test(period)||!entries||typeof entries!=='object'||Array.isArray(entries))bad();for(const [id,rows]of Object.entries(entries)){if(!ids.has(id)||!Array.isArray(rows)||rows.length>100)bad();for(const r of rows){if(typeof r.name!=='string'||r.name.length>150||r.percent!==null&&(!Number.isFinite(r.percent)||r.percent<0||r.percent>100))bad();}}}if(d.categories.some(c=>typeof c!=='string'||!c.trim()||c.length>150))bad();if(!Array.isArray(d.favorites)||d.favorites.length>5000||d.favorites.some(c=>typeof c!=='string'||!c.trim()||c.length>150)||!Array.isArray(d.lockedMonths)||d.lockedMonths.length>1200||d.lockedMonths.some(p=>!/^20\d\d-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$/.test(p)))bad();return d;}
export function categoryRank(name){const n=name.toLocaleLowerCase('ru');if(/продукт|супермаркет|бакале/.test(n))return 0;if(/аптек/.test(n))return 1;if(/ремонт|товары.*дом|дом.*товар|строй|строител/.test(n))return 2;if(/азс|заправ|топлив/.test(n))return 3;return 4;}
export function compareBanks(a,b,entries){const score=bank=>{const rows=(entries[bank.id]||[]).filter(r=>r.name.trim()),rank=rows.length?Math.min(...rows.map(r=>categoryRank(r.name))):5;return [rank,Math.max(0,...rows.filter(r=>categoryRank(r.name)===rank).map(r=>r.percent||0))];};const x=score(a),y=score(b);return x[0]-y[0]||y[1]-x[1]||a.name.localeCompare(b.name,'ru');}
